  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name='Car Insurance Claims' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria'>Car Insurance Claims</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98002' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99034' x='483' y='999'>
            <zone h='4494' id='3' type-v2='title' w='99034' x='483' y='999' />
            <zone h='12609' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='99034' x='483' y='5493' />
            <zone h='80899' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='99034' x='483' y='18102'>
              <flipboard active-id='3' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Car Insurance Claims' captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Driver Demographics Overview' captured-sheet='Driver Demographics Overview' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Vehicle Risk Analysis' captured-sheet='Vehicle Risk Analysis' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='Claim Behavior &amp; Severity' captured-sheet='Claim Behavior &amp; Severity' id='4' />
                  <story-point caption='Socioeconomic Impact on Claims' captured-sheet='Socioeconomic Impact on Claims' id='5' />
                  <story-point caption='Segmentation &amp; Risk Profiling' captured-sheet='Segmentation &amp; Risk Profiling' id='6' />
                  <story-point caption='Insights' captured-sheet='' id='7' />
                  <story-point caption='Insights' captured-sheet='' id='8' />
                  <story-point caption='Insights and Conclusions' captured-sheet='' id='9' />
                  <story-point caption='Thank You.' captured-sheet='' id='10' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='74782' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='93844' x='2716' y='22722'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='24'>Car Insurance Claims</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='77154' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='94206' x='2112' y='24594'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>From Dashboard 1: Driver Demographics</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Majority of drivers are aged 60–80.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Higher education strongly correlates with higher income.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Develop senior-driver risk pricing models.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Consider education-based segmentation for premium customization.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>From Dashboard 2: Vehicle Risk Analysis</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Car age shows minimal impact on claim frequency.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Higher Bluebook vehicles are associated with higher claim amounts.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Premium pricing should factor vehicle value more heavily than car age.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Luxury/commercial vehicles may require adjusted deductibles.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='74032' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='8' type-v2='text' w='95896' x='1388' y='25593'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>From Dashboard 3: Claim Behavior &amp; Severity</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Claim amounts are highly right-skewed (few extreme high claims).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Urban drivers tend to show higher claim amounts.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Introduce urban risk loading in pricing strategy.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Implement high-claim monitoring for extreme outliers.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>From Dashboard 4: Socioeconomic Impact</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Income level does not strongly reduce claim frequency.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Income alone should not be used as primary risk predictor.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='76280' hidden='true' id='9' story-point-id='9' type-v2='text' w='96801' x='1267' y='24719'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>From Dashboard 5: Segmentation &amp; Risk Profiling</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Commercial vehicle users exhibit higher average claim amounts.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Certain occupations show higher claim frequency trends.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Create occupation-based risk tiers.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Apply differentiated pricing for commercial vehicle users. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>Conclusions</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>1. Vehicle characteristics and usage patterns are stronger predictors of claim severity than demographic variables alone.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='16'>2. A segmented pricing strategy based on car type, vehicle value, and urbanicity can improve risk management and profitability.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='76030' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='10' type-v2='text' w='95534' x='1871' y='23596'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontname='Cambria' fontsize='24'>Thank You.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{CBBD00E1-9A20-4DEE-8A86-CA5D135EF03D}' />
    </dashboard>
